// M5-A3P-1003. Ch18 K08 "Iskarra." (C, 1 min). act3_ch18.md §2 K08. At the chart table Kerrid puts
// his finger on the drowned city. The anchor-engine is Ch19's: nobody explains it here.
title: ch18_iskarra
location: ch18/kite
---
@letterbox on
@camera K13
@mark kerrid chart_table walk
@anim kerrid point iskarra
@wait 3.0
Kerrid [neutral]: Iskarra. Where it started. Where we go in. #line:ch18_iskarra_001
@wait 4.0
<<set $ch18_complete = true>>
@letterbox off
